  "description": "Render barcodes (Code 128, Code 39, Code 93, Interleaved 2 of 5, Codabar, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, MSI, QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF417, Aztec) and Zebra ZPL II labels to PDF on top of EgoPDF.Generator and ZXing.Net. Targets net8.0 and net9.0. Preview release — API and rendering output may change without notice.",
