  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0-preview.3: ^FR (Field Reverse) handling on text fields. The flag was already honoured for ^GB rectangles; now a ^FR^FD over a dark ^GB rect renders the glyphs in white instead of being lost as black-on-black. Limitation: works visibly only where the underlying area is opaque (typical \"white text on black band\" pattern). New SampleZebra.GetSampleReverseText + visual baseline + WebDemo entry. Preview release -- surface still settling.",
